# Agent memory (local orientational knowledge, per ACC). The .proagent crew
# source and session are committed so the repo is self-contained.
.acc-memory.md
docs/.acc-memory.md
.acc/state/rollback/

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/

# Agent runtime state (per-machine): chat workspaces + session logs
chats/
.paw/

# Installer target output (spec 152 directory-per-layer) — a stray `paw init`
